# === ARTIFACT GOVERNANCE (Session 57 Migration) ===
# Large artifacts that should be stored in Tier 2/Tier 3 (SurrealDB/External)
# See: CLAUDE.md "Data Storage Architecture for Simulations"

# Simulation Artifacts (>50MB)
data/flume/checkpoints/*.pt
data/rl/checkpoints/*.pt
data/compound/checkpoints/*.pt
*.checkpoint
*.model
*.weights

# Diagnostic/Log Files (can grow unbounded)
src/diagnostics/*.log
src/diagnostics/process_list.log
logs/
*.log.*

# Large Data Files (document/analysis exports)
